# Production deployment authority surfaces.
#
# Coverage here is NOT a merge gate on its own: GitHub enforces it only when
# branch protection on `main` requires review from Code Owners. This file makes
# every surface that can change what production runs, or how it is deployed,
# routable to a required reviewer. No repository-wide `*` rule: a catch-all
# would make unrelated churn indistinguishable from deployment-authority drift.

